WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Two word parts run through this whole book.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.930
One is about remembering.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.930
One is about writing.

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:08.880
Isaac is doing both.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.460
Try to find them before the page tells you.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:17.160
When you get to the river game, say each word slowly and listen for where your voice stops.
